             An array option allowing widths of Unicode codepoints to be over‐
             ridden.  Note the new width applies to all clients.  Each entry
             is of the form _c_o_d_e_p_o_i_n_t_=_w_i_d_t_h, where codepoint may be a UTF-8
             character or an identifier of the form ‘U+number’ where the num‐
             ber is a hexadecimal number.

     ccooppyy--ccoommmmaanndd _s_h_e_l_l_-_c_o_m_m_a_n_d
