             ggrreeeenn, yyeellllooww, bblluuee, mmaaggeennttaa, ccyyaann, wwhhiittee; if supported the
             bright variants bbrriigghhttbbllaacckk, bbrriigghhttrreedd, ...; ccoolloouurr00 to ccoolloouurr225555
